OL,3,GNEWSAWhy getting dressed can trigger
OL,4,Adaily meltdowns for some children
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery morning, Zara faces the same
OL,7,Fchallenge.
OL,9,FHer seven-year-old daughter Valentina
OL,10,Frefuses to wear clothes that feel
OL,11,Ftight, have rough fabrics or buttons.
OL,12,FLabels are cut out of everything she
OL,13,Fowns. Finding an outfit she can
OL,14,Ftolerate can be exhausting.
OL,16,F"I'm always trying to avoid the
OL,17,Fdistress, the exhaustion, the
OL,18,Fmeltdowns, the difficulties in leaving
OL,19,Fthe house," Zara said.
OL,21,FFor Valentina, the wrong item of
OL,22,Fclothing can be overwhelming.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
